              'Architectural governance standard establishing brand umbrella rules and competitor sauce isolation: 1) Shoman & Al-Dorra Umbrella Brand Governance: establishes that Al-Durra (الدرة / درة / دره / د ر ه / Dorra / Durra) and Seyidoglu (سيد أوغلو) are authorized brands manufactured and distributed by Shoman Food Industries, qualifying all genuine Al-Durra SKUs for Shoman campaigns and vice versa. 2) True Competitor Sauce Isolation: strictly disqualifies genuine competitor sauce brands (Heinz, Goody, Harvest, Knorr, Fine Foods, Americana) setting isTargetCompany = false. 3) Unicode-Safe Arabic Branch Token Preservation: uses CompanyGiftsService.normalizeBranchToken to preserve Arabic letters (\\u0600-\\u06FF) while stripping parenthetical governorates. 4) Anti-City Collision in Store Code Resolution: resolves POS store codes (e.g. Store 211 = Smouha) directly against approved campaign branches without spurious city-level collisions.',
